{"id":"parent#smardex-ecosystem","name":"SMARDEX Ecosystem","url":"https://smardex.io","description":"SMARDEX is building tomorrow's DeFi ecosystem! Powered by the $SDEX token","logo":"https://icons.llamao.fi/icons/protocols/smardex-ecosystem","gecko_id":null,"cmcId":null,"chains":["Ethereum","BSC","Polygon","Arbitrum","Base"],"twitter":"every_thing","stablecoins":["smardex-usdn"],"symbol":"SDEX","address":"0x5de8ab7e27f6e7a1fff3e5b337584aa43961beef","linkedProtocols":["SMARDEX Ecosystem","SMARDEX AMM","SMARDEX P2P Lending"],"childProtocols":[{"name":"SMARDEX AMM","defillamaId":"2695","displayName":"SMARDEX AMM","methodologyURL":"https://github.com/DefiLlama/dimension-adapters/blob/master/fees/smardex","methodology":{"UserFees":"\nA minor fee is collected on each swap, functioning as trading fees.\nThe fees are set at 0.07% on Ethereum and 0.1% on other chains.\nOn other networks, fees may vary between different pairs and chains.\nRefer to https://docs.smardex.io/overview/what-is-smardex/fees for detailed information.\n","Fees":"\nA minor fee is collected on each swap, functioning as trading fees.\nThe fees are set at 0.07% on Ethereum and 0.1% on other chains.\nOn other networks, fees may vary between different pairs and chains.\nRefer to https://docs.smardex.io/overview/what-is-smardex/fees for detailed information.\n","Revenue":"0.02% of each swap on Ethereum is collected for staking pool (SDEX holders that staked). On other chains, 0.03% of each swap is collected for buybacks and burns. Refer to https://docs.smardex.io/overview/what-is-smardex/fees for detailed information.","ProtocolRevenue":"Protocol has no revenue.","HoldersRevenue":"0.02% of each swap on Ethereum is collected for staking pool (SDEX holders that staked). On other chains staking is not available and fees are collected for buybacks SDEX and burns.","SupplySideRevenue":"0.05% of each swap on Ethereum is collected for liquidity providers. On other chains, 0.07% of each swap is collected for liqui